# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 8.2 Area under simple curves
d.sec('8.2-area-under-curves')
b('Area under y = f(x) from x = a to x = b (f ≥ 0)?', T('A = ∫ₐᵇ y dx = ∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx') + ': the sum of thin vertical strips of height y and width dx (the elementary strip)')
