b('Ex 8.1 Q4: area bounded by y² = 4x, the y-axis and y = 3 is (A) 2 (B) 9/4 (C) 9/3 (D) 9/2', '∫₀³ (y²/4) dy = [y³/12]₀³ = 27/12 = ' + E('(B) 9/4'))
